# EMDR — use nura-ui-designer for UI/UX

When the task touches **UI, UX, layout, visual design, typography, spacing, components, pages, modals, empty states, marketing sections, onboarding, auth chrome, sidebar, header, or admin visuals**:

1. **Read and follow** `.cursor/skills/nura-ui-designer/SKILL.md` before designing or coding UI.
2. Explicit invoke: `/nura-ui-designer` or “nura-ui-designer”.
3. Still obey `nura-brand`, `product-ui`, `page-copy-design-review`, and `verify-before-done`.
4. Do **not** use the retired `apple-ui` skill or Apple HIG / Inter / `#007AFF` for Nura product work.
5. **Fraunces** = home hero title only (decorative). Never on other landing sections, `/app`, `/admin`, or legal/long-form (`/terms`, `/privacy`) — those use Source Sans 3.
6. Home **How it works** (Attio sticky `SessionPathSticky`): follow `nura-ui-designer` → **Sticky session path** — badge How it works, `#how-it-works` on section start, stacked stages, mid-viewport pin, fade intro H2, letter-rise on stage/pair/finale titles. After Between sessions: `SessionLoopKit` chip marquee (same band). Then **topic modules** (`SessionTopicsGrid`). Then Intercom-style **one app / two experiences** (`SessionModesPair`) — tabs AI agent-guided session + Self-guided session, video slots (not photos). Then Reflex-style pause (`HomePauseCta`) — empty field, large centered title, Get started. Then Memory sets (`HomeMemorySets`) — left session chat mock (type in composer → user bubble → brief Memory loading → agent reply); right kicker Memory + H2 + three short points. No Why Nura. No second How it works band (`fe-how-section` / “Personalized care, every step”). No **Inside the app** showcase (`fe-showcase-section`).
7. **Letter-rise is mandatory** on marketing section H2s (`LetterRevealHeading`). “Same scroll animation as other sections” = letters rising, **not** GSAP `.fe-animate`. See `.cursor/rules/letter-rise-headings.mdc` — do not skip.
8. **Centered title + sub above cards** — flex `gap` on the container (not margin-only), clear overlay header pill, equal vertical rhythm. See `.cursor/rules/marketing-section-spacing.mdc` + nura-ui-designer → **Centered section heads**.
